---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us | RealSalaryCheck">
  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24 text-left">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center sm:text-left">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight mb-4" style="color: var(--logo-primary)">About RealSalaryCheck</h1>
      <p class="text-sm md:text-base font-medium leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-secondary)">
        Bridging the gap between nominal gross numbers and actual lifestyle realities for global professionals, remote engineers, and expats.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 space-y-8 shadow-xl" style="background-color: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--card-border);">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold" style="color: var(--text-primary)">Our Mission & Vision</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-secondary)">
          When professionals evaluate international or cross-border job opportunities, standard market nominal exchange rates often obscure the real economic picture. RealSalaryCheck was built to instantly resolve this fragmentation by evaluating financial purchasing power through normalized macroeconomic indices. Our purpose is to help talent avoid the financial pitfalls of relocation by showing them their real disposable income velocity.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold" style="color: var(--text-primary)">The Core Methodology</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-secondary)">
          This application leverages current regional Purchasing Power Parity (PPP) conversion vectors. By adjusting for differences in local price levels, our computational engine models what an offered foreign compensation structure actually delivers relative to your local day-to-day cost of living. Instead of simple forex multiplication, we evaluate the comparative capacity of localized consumer spending baskets.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold" style="color: var(--text-primary)">Data Transparency & Integrity</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-secondary)">
          Our mathematical framework queries live interbank spot feeds paired with periodic macroeconomic indicator updates from trusted global tracking databases, including the World Bank. Calculations perform dynamically on the client side to maximize execution speed with minimal latency, providing a reliable baseline for salary negotiations.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>